Warrant's kernel (src/Warrant.Kernel) is a C# port of the Lean 4 kernel
(src/kernel/ at Lean v4.33.1, re-diffed against v4.35.0), informed by the following works:

  Lean 4 (https://github.com/leanprover/lean4)
  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  The original Lean 4 kernel was authored by Leonardo de Moura.

  Ansatz (https://github.com/replikativ/ansatz)
  Copyright 2026 Christian Weilbach
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  A Java reimplementation of the Lean 4 kernel, used as a reference
  for this port.

Lean libraries (Init, Std, Mathlib) imported via lean4export
(https://github.com/leanprover/lean4export) remain under their own licenses.
